AI Digital Twin · Google Cloud: Commercial workloads enter through our authenticated Cloud Run hub router and Hub VPC consumer endpoint.

3
00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:30.083
AI Digital Twin · Google Cloud: Instead of fragile VPC peering, our Private Service Connect attachment bridges Hub and Spoke unidirectionally.

4
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:40.106
AI Digital Twin · Google Cloud: Inspecting service attachment details confirms our active consumer forwarding rule with no CIDR collisions or transitive routing.

5
