AI Digital Twin · Google Cloud: After promotion, enterprise workloads land inside an isolated Spoke VPC backed by dedicated Cloud Run compute.

6
00:00:50.136 --> 00:01:00.159
AI Digital Twin · Google Cloud: Notice complete subnet isolation separates the commercial hub from this dedicated sovereign enterprise spoke project.

7
00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:10.189
